## Missions (Phase 3)
cl.missao.peneira.titulo=Prospector
cl.missao.peneira.desc=Craft a Sieve (sticks, string and planks) and place it.
cl.missao.garimpo.titulo=Gold in the sand
cl.missao.garimpo.desc=Sift 20 blocks of sand or gravel. Seeds, clay, nuggets and even saplings come out.
cl.missao.argila.titulo=Clay
cl.missao.argila.desc=Collect 8 clay balls from the sieve.
cl.missao.compostor.titulo=Nothing goes to waste
cl.missao.compostor.desc=Craft a Dirt Composter (planks and dirt) and place it.
cl.missao.adubo.titulo=Fresh soil
cl.missao.adubo.desc=Fill the composter with scraps (rotten flesh works!) and take 3 dirt out of it.
cl.missao.condensador_avancado.titulo=More water
cl.missao.condensador_avancado.desc=Upgrade the condenser: Advanced Condenser (copper, glass and the condenser).
cl.missao.estufa.titulo=Greenhouse
cl.missao.estufa.desc=Craft a Greenhouse (glass, condenser and copper). It keeps soil wet and speeds up plants around it.
cl.missao.fazenda.titulo=Desert farm
cl.missao.fazenda.desc=Collect 32 wheat.

## Food and life (Phase 4)
item.cl:fruta_cacto.name=Cactus Fruit
cl.sede.rotulo=§bWater§r
cl.sede.morrendo=§cYou are dying of thirst! Drink water (bottle from the condenser), milk or eat cactus fruit.
cl.capsula.titulo=§6Cargo pod!
cl.capsula.subtitulo=Falling near %s, %s, %s
cl.capsula.encontrada=You found a cargo pod. Open the barrel and look after the animals: there are no others left on this planet.

## Missions (Phase 4)
cl.missao.capsula.titulo=Lost cargo
cl.missao.capsula.desc=A pod from the ship falls every morning. Go to the impact site.
cl.missao.garrafa.titulo=Canteen
cl.missao.garrafa.desc=Craft bowls (3 planks), tap a full condenser holding them and have 3 Good Water. Drinking quenches thirst.
cl.missao.fruta.titulo=Desert fruit
cl.missao.fruta.desc=Break cacti and collect 3 cactus fruits. They ease hunger and thirst.
cl.missao.rebanho.titulo=Herd
cl.missao.rebanho.desc=Breed two animals from the pod (wheat for cows and sheep, seeds for chickens, carrots for pigs).
cl.missao.couro.titulo=Leather
cl.missao.couro.desc=Collect 3 leather.
cl.missao.despensa.titulo=Full pantry
cl.missao.despensa.desc=Keep 10 bread stored.
cl.missao.criador.titulo=Breeder
cl.missao.criador.desc=Breed 5 more babies.
cl.missao.sinais.titulo=Signals from the ship
cl.missao.sinais.desc=Find 3 more cargo pods.

